{"job_id":"F-bad768b02942bf517212","family_id":"F-bad768b02942bf517212","title":"정부대표 및 특별사절의 임명과 권한에 관한 법률","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":26,"target_id":"4f7784162ab6608803b4e127a7942c9741a670850e6f9549e4accb37720886d4","source_hash":"306fe98c179b698a4e7a9fb51c9acebf87e5fa1b88ce164ee0e8d78adb4f968d","text":"关于政府代表和特使的任命和权限的法案"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":283,"target_id":"e634e837574445eaecc0c205ebad4925eeaa4d006073afb3011a45d8b318707d","source_hash":"d128a5f3a4676c81ed29c4d5fabe2fd6a09a04b53e8650aec51737fedb2fcbdf","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是规定代表政府为特定目的与外国政府或国际组织进行谈判、出席国际会议、签署或发起条约的人员（以下简称“政府代表”）的任命和权限，以及为特定目的出席在国外举行的重大仪式、向外国政府或国际组织传达政府立场和看法、与外国政府或国际组织进行谈判、出席国际会议的人员（以下简称“特使”）的任命和权限，以及其他必要事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":283,"end":364,"target_id":"7ae357b318019ae0e4d40c67475473547cf35e138dd885dd9b19c3b16e4e10bb","source_hash":"4e2df8d6e9697c7eee0a3f6d49300bed50a09eee8b08ae86af4edb00ffcb3106","text":"第二条（某人可以代表政府行事的情况）除本法或其他法律另有规定外，任何人不得代表政府实施第一条所规定的行为。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":364,"end":455,"target_id":"e63df5e6fbbb1feb8942eb932c3ee66552f7d95a6a1bd8b4bbd7a7e0995185c7","source_hash":"e83857b7a4c5f37bec72289e3ac2c481778e0da7c0e7ae8b711670d0485ddaa1","text":"第三条（外交部长）外交部长作为政府代表，参与与外国政府或国际组织的谈判，出席国际会议，并签署或草拟条约。<2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":455,"end":560,"target_id":"5605229fdceb7424d1d607d9d7375887ce443b6cd03cb4038376326ca500cdc8","source_hash":"7bea1df3813cc506de4eb5d32f3793cfed581bc305b15b4c3b3cb3daec6d1bc6","text":"第四条（驻外使团团长）大韩民国驻外使团团长，如为特命全权大使，在与已获递交国书的外国政府或国际组织进行谈判时，应作为韩国政府的代表。<2020年3月31日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":560,"end":1009,"target_id":"fbaba8f7209402037c7c6d149fb525c6ff0eed3bdb7a606c8002bedf05820f3f","source_hash":"5badaa996c17097f288c94cc475d1fc0c6230745fd20d65166d6c16907e55b38","text":"第五条（政府代表等的任命）\n① 除第三条和第四条另有规定外，政府代表由外交部长任命。但是，政府代表如需与外国政府或国际组织就重要事项进行谈判、出席重要国际会议或签署、草拟重要条约，则应由总统根据外交部长的建议，通过总理任命。<2013年3月23日修订>\n② 特使由总统根据外交部长的建议，通过总理任命。<2013年3月23日修订>\n③ 外交部长应签署根据第一款正文任命的政府代表的全权委托书或国书；总统应签署根据第一款但书或第二款但书任命的政府代表或特使的全权委托书或国书，总理和外交部长应副署；但即便如此，外交部长也可根据国际惯例签署。<2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1009,"end":1145,"target_id":"e9ef55aff78b55b3f02d335b76723fd0d644c8970dab925b9158c817da5099e8","source_hash":"c5774c29c615bf2a1c170d628051e156bf7fac2b3b6ed1278cc080f5f01ae36c","text":"第五条之二（对外称谓的指定）总统认为有必要时，可根据外交部长的建议，经内阁审议，指定政府代表或特使的对外称谓为“特命全权大使”或“大使”。（2013年3月23日修订）\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1145,"end":1276,"target_id":"3e2d2056d500e2bcf0caf0947296baac5425a1f66edc49aa80b5870b7f98cab3","source_hash":"c25c0a47aba7c1788eabfaa70a10f85827f23e6bb35731997f87a40107b24a3d","text":"第六条（政府的指导和监督）政府代表进行的外交谈判，应由外交部长指导和监督。与外国或驻韩国际经济组织进行经济协调事宜，也应征求外交部长的意见。<2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1276,"end":1428,"target_id":"d0586ee5acfec948006035c97ac47145dd8bcbe3017adee8d471181cf284dc95","source_hash":"f4dc45509f680d085ce7ad34a41e60319e01d15224787397fd70c300e42f5170","text":"第七条（政府首席代表等）\n① 委任两名或两名以上政府代表或特使时，必须确定资历顺序，并指定一名首席政府代表或首席特使。\n首席政府代表或首席特使指导和监督其他政府代表或特使，并代表政府代表团或特使代表团。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1428,"end":1518,"target_id":"d32f692d0ceaf94bb3d9c078912d291723461e4885ffb469617e38c252e6a24f","source_hash":"35b138134136f0639708c14f87681d52f9621f5157962033995144233793c6b4","text":"第八条（代理职务）首席政府代表或首席特使因不可抗力无法履行职务时，由级别次高的政府代表或特使代为履行职务。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1518,"end":1631,"target_id":"d8456175f5bde38511edbd1f25ebc6e3e3b6382c16a7359df23d745c7dbfa1d7","source_hash":"63ee70061e4b4cbae4abd23e2151d40cb5f3f8c60981d8e76a933bb38b30b52a","text":"第九条（随行人员）外交部长如认为必要，可委任顾问、专家委员会成员、助理或其他随行人员协助政府代表或特使处理事务。<2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1631,"end":1834,"target_id":"bfe9ee7baa7ffef2a5bd82f9be8b56a92879fa9467569807735b86872c6a9636","source_hash":"b4037c663433b247802a1e2080d907bfb450739f68d9d7834d16e0ddcfc90a22","text":"第 10 条（解雇）\n① 政府代表或特使及其随行人员在完成其委派的任务后，除其他法律另有明确规定外，应解除职务。\n② 根据第5条第2款被指定为特命全权大使或大使的政府代表或特使，根据第1款被解除职务时，其“特命全权大使”或“大使”的外部称号即告失效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1834,"end":2460,"target_id":"1321ad41fc8c0baf7a40a6f63e6ada6398fe599c36f64ad47b4af937ad2fec0d","source_hash":"900da79499bed4ac91ebb5a3fd4c5f8ec849a82db7f7818e19386061a10039d8","text":"第11条（关于在缔结贸易条约谈判期间任命政府代表等的特别规定）\n① 尽管有第五条第一款的规定，但根据《缔结和执行贸易条约程序法》第二条第一款的规定，指定政府代表进行旨在缔结贸易条约的谈判时，应适用下列方法：<2025年10月1日修订>\n1. 在第五条第一款正文规定的情况下，外交部长应贸易、工业和能源部长的要求任命。\n2. 在符合第 5 条第 1 款但书规定的情况下，总统应根据贸易、工业和能源部长的建议，通过总理任命。\n② 尽管有第五条第三款的规定，根据第一款第二项任命的政府代表所获得的正式授权委托书或委任状，应当由总统签署，并由总理和产业通商资源大臣复签。在此情况下，外交部长可以按照国际惯例签署。<2025年10月1日修订>\n③ 尽管有第六条第一款的规定，但根据第一款任命的政府代表进行贸易谈判时，贸易、工业和能源大臣应当进行指导和监督。在这种情况下，贸易、工业和能源大臣应当事先将指导和监督的详情通知外交部长。<2025年10月1日修订>\n④ 贸易、工业和能源部长如欲根据第1款同意或签署贸易条约文本，应事先征得外交部长的意见。<2025年10月1日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2460,"end":2551,"target_id":"a3b9d4875bb903d51554bac1db263473a4602e4b9d525374ea4bba3ff3494287","source_hash":"7d853a702ce40551379414b05839bf7526805c1149edd80ba00185ca7a74c22c","text":"补充规定 <第1081号，1962年5月31日>\n\n①本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n② 在本法生效时，特命全权专员或政府代表应视为已根据本法任命。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2551,"end":2619,"target_id":"112c40b1bf73d50ced049855c75ede3f1868a9d3b5f81784c3b10997f674b7d7","source_hash":"8f09224c58c854ef8f47399280c9af0523493ad2f0d1a578ef95fa2f7e163366","text":"补充条款 <第1549号，1963年12月16日>\n\n本法自1962年12月26日颁布的修正宪法生效之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2619,"end":2725,"target_id":"9bba366efdc900abe59546ac999de2467eb1f1dc20af39b15165a999d472c866","source_hash":"37eaa655cbc3224cd3075da278e12d1583001358b54350d0f03e43e92d75905e","text":"补充规定 <第3758号，1984年12月31日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（过渡措施）本法实施时政府代表或特使应视为已按照本法任命。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2725,"end":2755,"target_id":"0f142c0712f933ba24cebe3aab59f082522dbae675d96b237d21ebfe0e187aed","source_hash":"9f984faffebd91642f1e26e75c1ab3649e306236dd38deee54e7ee1495f626a6","text":"补充条款（政府组织法）<第8852号法令，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2755,"end":2885,"target_id":"184a9471537c10d00b32589891fefe48a4d477068f60c12ec9459944262a9746","source_hash":"c9866fc3647400bf809a2d5a6d40220d9769256fadb5f4380fabfee20afc7b3a","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，……<省略>……，根据附录第六条修正的法律中，修正在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律的条款，应自各相关法律的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2885,"end":2902,"target_id":"ae6263e7132820cd84d38610d6671f904b9286f74c581fbc04138b985e1dfcfc","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第2至5条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2902,"end":3084,"target_id":"9360e2e8545966c319be6562089023578b8923d143eb1df59e1b55d50512249c","source_hash":"689be0b87299bb8b8340a63cdad452d26652e0677d4803470f5f810b3d3f2cc6","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<167> 已删除\n\n  <168> 《政府代表和特使的任命和权限法》部分修订如下。\n\n  在第3条、第5条（第1至3款）、第5条第2款、第6条第一款和第二款以及第9条中，“外交部长”应改为“外交和贸易部长”。\n\n  <169> 至 <760> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3084,"end":3092,"target_id":"d3d68d0dc5ad66f86d100fd928a5c9ad4660ec9e86cf847510b81c134f1f68e0","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3092,"end":3136,"target_id":"d227e7188186acec2dfdab6a3e8a55dc98ad75479afccf99ff6a2d34c3eedb24","source_hash":"3f4b4f26f7f1b552e0612dd5992a511581d09b5db8c3c5abe9baec73d93f0615","text":"补充规定 <2010年5月20日第10308号>\n\n本法自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3136,"end":3160,"target_id":"c4f329c068057082a7227897e53ae513df5d5c8d33a8943f238a71f491f72440","source_hash":"1234868f61d8892699c8a863923e5d80399629cfae1d0f735676276fb28bbb68","text":"补充规定 <第11687号，2013年3月23日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3160,"end":3189,"target_id":"3f5e31d1b18a882a43aa3121648f1ffc1b1ab9b3b51664a91f479450a29dcb29","source_hash":"fb5b512a97e9ea37002f61bddc2be78ed1fd3a84c0a6dca866bf42b810b2e6f7","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3189,"end":3499,"target_id":"02b87cd984faadf1618446ef7ad62917c9d21f689e219b0a99fedc6b4a46f915","source_hash":"36032d715145f19f62dd6d51452756aa383cf1cd19f428cf597d787babd00090","text":"第二条（关于指定政府代表等的过渡措施）① 在本法生效时，根据原法第五条第一款为缔结贸易条约程序法第二条第一款缔结贸易条约而进行谈判的政府代表，应视为根据第十一条第一款的修正规定而指定。 \n\n  ② 根据前《贸易条约缔结和执行程序法》第2条第1款，在《贸易条约缔结和执行程序法》生效时，向为缔结贸易条约而指定的政府代表签发的任何完全授权委托书或证明文件，应视为根据第11条第2款的修正规定签发。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3499,"end":3538,"target_id":"22b6955d036d2ab30b060c9c3f8b46c155c1e73c10e341065c83af24d58dc0a4","source_hash":"41095091baa2def27180e5bc6dd67765d134f30e7f8ca491bd58a00db396ab43","text":"补充条款（关于设立大韩民国驻外使团的法令）<第17160号法令，2020年3月31日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3538,"end":3567,"target_id":"5053aeddef4340bcfbf118c229a1f1d2f2161fbfdb4c8fdf3db70f2bd419ce94","source_hash":"fb5b512a97e9ea37002f61bddc2be78ed1fd3a84c0a6dca866bf42b810b2e6f7","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3567,"end":3637,"target_id":"c2a0409759f3be3ddbebd98afd6e535b1300e73174c96dc6f83a955b7abbf5ef","source_hash":"d1bcab7aab44b8f35d0b3bb32c0a9a7f1147e9dfc35f347888299eac72cca676","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ②《政府代表和特使的任命和权限法》部分修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3637,"end":3704,"target_id":"2ae45d4fa84be3a05682eb9669bca8e335cf76b3b53894fd327f098a72fb960d","source_hash":"65640e540342eaabe2168bc1161dda3b057f0cf2521c75acc0a68bd4f1fabfef","text":"  第 4 条中的“特命全权大使或特命全权公使”应改为“特命全权大使”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3704,"end":3735,"target_id":"78b6385564a881da653d02b7215e66824621a4db200b54dd6497fe6907c70791","source_hash":"3480e86a86ef9ad8c919b6a09b870d318b15d3a9f68ecd56d35864dbf3fed08b","text":"补充条款（政府组织法）<第21065号法令，2025年10月1日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3735,"end":3878,"target_id":"923641e516fe3872e02b7cf2aa82ed1f640b311b132b06d9cffeecfab2a87fe1","source_hash":"7aeb3bf0b40bd4c144c8ceaa24f9d7b38fcbb008f987298b83e74652288bac8a","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，根据附录第七条修正的法律中，修正在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律的条款，自各相关法律的生效日期起生效……<省略>……\n\n  1. 和 2. 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3878,"end":3895,"target_id":"b7cb255aa5cd7c1a08d590896918285c2720db10ed6b5381ba9451f78356256c","source_hash":"bc6c318c350b2ff1aac4a31f65fcae9d049d5f2d9358ead70ed1a2e0bc93798c","text":"省略第2至6条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3895,"end":4093,"target_id":"711e32bc83a6c42bec863cea61093302c16bebc2c97c30c8f7beb7081c494b7f","source_hash":"708214b753cc6bb7d454a29155b89190f08b2cd34c609b02dcb96200c109df98","text":"第七条（其他法律的修正）①至<107>款已省略\n\n  《政府代表和特使的任命和权限法》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  在第 11 条第 1 款第 1 项和第 2 项、该条第 2 款第 1 部分、该条第 3 款第 1 部分和第 2 部分以及该条第 4 款中，“贸易、工业和能源大臣”应改为“贸易、工业和能源大臣”。\n\n  <109> 至 <626> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000007-276265-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4093,"end":4099,"target_id":"155aa6299804325dccb8bea8f18f4cc122168df30eae8b25c32d5e4a85f97388","source_hash":"ce9e83eae4c8866b9806b56fe62a5bee313e7744a910c2dc81b0d251c1d9c745","text":"第 8 条省略"}]}